WEBVTT

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:41.810
Good morning!

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:45.560
Well, I was about to go to sleep...

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.180
Good night!

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:50.920
Hey, guess what the day after tomorrow is!

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:52.750
The day after tomorrow?

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:54.010
Right!

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.320
See, see, see?

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.060
Is it a full moon?

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:01.050
Correct!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:05.080
Full moon, full moon, shopping, shopping!

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:18.010
Good morning!

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:19.260
Mornin'.

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:21.280
Guess what tomorrow is!

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:26.230
What? Hm... tomorrow...

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:27.120
Right!

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.540
Tomorrow?

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.040
Tomorrow?

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:32.280
Non-burnable trash.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.880
That's right, but...

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.090
What else is it?

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.210
You don't know!

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:43.100
It's a full moon!

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.020
Good morning!

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.440
Guess what today is!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.570
Good morning, Liru-san.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:06.160
I know. It's a full moon, right?

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.210
Aiko, you're absolutely correct!

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.060
I can't sit around like this. I need to go out and shop!

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:15.130
Haven't you bought plenty by now?

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.170
Nah, I'm only starting on the main dish now!

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:22.220
Oh, really? Well then, look out for cars.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:24.250
Okay!

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:26.470
Aiko, you're a good one!

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.460
Okay, I'll wind you up!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:29.280
U-um...

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.090
Don't worry about it!

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:40.450
A Richly-Flavored Spell is the Night of the Full Moon!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:41.490
Pokaan ~ 13

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:53.400
I'll take this!

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.410
Oh, welcome!

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:56.960
I'll throw in any of these as an extra!

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:58.370
An extra?

00:03:58.370 --> 00:03:59.210
Really?

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.200
Yep!

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.500
What'll it be?

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.220
The squid is great today!

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.990
Squid, hm...

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:09.130
Chewing on a grilled squid and watching the full moon would be so nice...

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.210
Hey! Will you grill this for me?

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.230
I'll barbeque it. Sure thing!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.770
Then I'll come back later to pick it up, so four please!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.230
Okay, thanks!

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.360
Okay...

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.380
Next up is the convenience store.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:25.240
Welcome!

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:28.180
Hm... wet tissues...

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:29.970
Here we go!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:34.250
This, oolong tea, calpis soda, and...

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:38.300
Oh yeah, I need to get this too!

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:45.250
Ma'am, would you like some fries or a hot dog with that?

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:49.140
We're currently running a special where they're 20% off!

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:54.690
Then, I'll get two orders of fries and four hot dogs.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.300
Understood!

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:58.150
As always, thank you very much for shopping with us.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:01.930
Hm?

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.950
What, these are half off?!

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:05.360
No way!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.360
Would you like some?

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:09.710
Half off...

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:14.090
Well, I might as well get some of these to go with the other stuff.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:16.420
Okay, I'll take ten daifuku!

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.420
Thank you very much!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.920
Okay, it's time for the main dish!

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:27.050
I'm ready to order!

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:29.010
Thank you!

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:33.720
I'll take ten mincemeat croquettes, um, two pork cutlets, and two kilograms of karaage meat!

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:36.540
Thanks a bunch!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.730
I'll throw in a little something extra.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:40.810
Thank you!

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:43.730
As the extra, can I have 1 kilogram of Matsuzaka steak?

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:45.080
Ma'am...

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:46.580
That's a little...

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:48.740
Hm? No...?

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.920
Then...

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:54.750
50 grams, please.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.930
Oh well...

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.750
Okay, I'll add in a free steak!

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:06.510
Keep this a secret from the wife, okay?

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.140
A secret?

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:11.790
So something between the two of us?

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:12.920
Thank you...

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:16.960
Big catch! Big catch!

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.650
I-is today something special?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.450
Oh yeah...

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.110
Watching the moon!

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:42.120
When are we going to start tonight?

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:44.000
What should I do about dinner?

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:48.530
I bought plenty of food, so don't worry about it!

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:52.100
The moon should come up at 4:45 tonight,

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:55.180
And come into full view at eleven!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:58.520
So for dinner, how about we start at about seven?

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:00.580
Seven, is it?

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:06.530
That's still four more hours away...

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:07.640
What?

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.200
We only have four hours?

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.530
I can't sit around like this!

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:14.130
Then, I'll be off getting us a spot!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:16.570
Everyone come over when it's time!

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:17.780
Uh, okay...

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:19.370
Alright, I'm going ahead!

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:22.040
Huh?

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.400
Later guys!

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:25.770
See ya.

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:54.240
I was thinking right about here would be good!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:56.910
Yeah...

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:01.320
The moon comes out right about there, and it rises like this, so...

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:03.920
Looks like this is the best position!

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:06.680
Okay, time to prepare!

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:24.160
Well, this looks good.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:31.200
I lucked out. No one else came here to get a spot!

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.480
If you come now, you already missed out!

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:35.920
All of them are such amateurs at moon-watching!

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:46.250
Oh yeah...

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.460
I never ate a real lunch.

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:51.730
It's so beautiful...

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.450
Tomorrow's going to be clear, too.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.970
Oh, where did this come from?

00:08:57.990 --> 00:08:58.920
This, this!

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:01.970
This will be tonight's special treat!

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:06.480
But I should really just hold out until the moon comes out...

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:11.780
I bet it'll melt in my mouth...

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.670
It's so beautiful!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:19.910
It's totally round!

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.490
Liru-san is waiting for us!

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:38.130
Thanks for waiting!

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.180
You guys are late!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.520
Sorry.

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:46.940
Okay, let's get started!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.870
We're watching the moon!!

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:49.650
Here, here!

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:56.530
I have sweet dumplings, chips, chocolate, juice, mincemeat, karaage meat, hot dogs and sandwiches!!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:10:00.160
I've got grilled squid and matsuzaka steak, too!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:03.290
Wow! This is amazing!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.790
You have everything!

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:07.560
I can't believe you got all this on your own!

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.290
This is impressive, Liru-san!

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.880
Isn't it?

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:15.000
A moon watching this extravagant doesn't happen very often!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:19.250
Okay, let's eat and drink, and watch the moon, and enjoy the night!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.300
Yay!

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:33.700
Aww, she looks so happy!

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:37.740
She was really worked up over the past few days...

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.700
She was so busy, so she didn't have much time to sleep at all.

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:44.040
Here, here, meat!

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:47.200
That scared me!

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:50.920
You're such a dumbass sometimes!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.840
What are the two of you doing?

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.870
Liru-san, Liru-san!

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:57.360
Please wake up.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:59.720
It's time to watch the moon!

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:05.720
We should let her sleep, Ai-chan.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:23.400
There, there.

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:09.450
A Combining Spell Is the

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:09.450
Invincible Robot, M5!

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:09.450
Pokaan ~ 14

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:13.460
Anime Research Institute

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:16.250
What happened?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.110
It's terrible!

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:19.250
The refinery plant...

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:23.430
The refinery plant is being assaulted by a giant robot!

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.260
What?

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:30.270
If this place goes down, we'll lose the ability to use the M5!

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:32.680
We need to hurry up and take that guy down!

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:35.680
Quick, we should assemble the Magical 5!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:36.230
Okay!

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:38.920
Wait a second! Aiko isn't here!

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:39.780
What's wrong?

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:42.850
Now that you mention it, she's not here, is she...

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:44.280
Hey, look at that!

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:49.790
Aiko, why are you there...?

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:54.290
How are you doing, Magical Five?

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.060
Doctor K-ko!

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:58.400
So this was all your doing!

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:00.420
Yes, it was me.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.800
You coward, capturing one of us!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.980
Oh, was that not allowed?

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:09.010
I'm do my evil deeds in a fair and balanced manner!

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:12.050
Is there something that bad guys aren't supposed to do?

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:13.580
What kind of sophistry is that?

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:18.090
Now, now, if you don't hurry up, your precious anvil girl will die!

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:20.660
How about trying to stop it?

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:23.780
If you can even manage an attack on the Mecha-Hongo!

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:28.060
What'll we do?

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:29.170
Let's launch!

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.090
What?

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:33.330
Even though Aiko is on her own, we're going to dispatch?

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:37.800
So are you saying we should just sit here and twiddle our thumbs?!

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:40.480
She's right, even if it's just us...

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:42.340
Okay, let's go!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.970
Magical Five

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:11.990
Launch!

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:25.300
Destructo Beam!

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.000
No, no more!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:29.370
Please don't destroy any more!

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.140
Oh, that's-

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:33.570
I see it!

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:35.780
I won't let him get away with this!

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.140
Let's combine!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:38.390
Okay!

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:10.760
Complete!

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:13.570
Magical Five!

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:30.420
This is a one-sided fight!

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:31.350
At this rate...

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:32.370
We might go down!

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.910
Everyone, it's time to retreat!

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.910
Roger!

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:40.790
Just look at that dilapidated mess!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.440
I've...

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.680
Defeated them...

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:45.920
The Magical Five!

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:58.640
Something like that happening...

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:02.660
There's no way we can win without being able to combine.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.810
If Aiko has been taken from us...

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:10.610
We'll just cut something else out, and launch Aiko's Unit #3!

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:12.110
Okay!

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:34.080
Magical Five

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:34.720
Launch!

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:48.110
Everyone!

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.900
Sorry for the wait, Aiko!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.300
We'll save you in no time!

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:52.530
Let's combine!

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:53.070
Okay!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:20.030
Magical Five!

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:24.020
Modern Art?

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:31.630
This is a one-sided fight!

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:32.770
At this rate...

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:33.700
We might go down!

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:36.280
Everyone, it's time to retreat!

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:38.320
Roger!

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:45.830
That was dangerous.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:48.130
Screw danger!

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:51.450
Why did we launch two Unit #3s?!

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:52.490
Seriously...

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:55.280
We're fine with just one!

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.180
Got it? I'll fly Unit #3.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.620
It'll be fine with just me, okay?

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:00.850
Okay!

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.610
Magical Five

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.650
Go!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.370
No, no.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.160
When I say "It'll be fine with just me," I don't mean <i>that</i> !

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:27.250
Donmai!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.960
Why are <i>you</i> saying <i>that</i>?!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.980
Okay, teamwork is important, right?!

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:36.010
Next time let's make all our hearts into one!

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:36.930
You're right!

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:38.010
Okay!

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:52.900
Magical Five!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:53.690
Launch!

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:00.250
I didn't mean that!

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:02.950
How the hell are we supposed to combine with all the same pieces?

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.530
C'mon, you idiots!

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:13.630
I can't follow a moron like her!

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.100
Aren't you a moron too, Pachira?

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:19.120
Liru, this isn't your own solo battle, is it?

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:22.970
That's why I told you I'd be riding Unit #3 earlier!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.530
Listen to me, you damn idiot!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.080
You wanna fight!?

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:26.840
You gonna?

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:27.890
Do it, do it!

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:29.460
Don't butt in, you!

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:32.960
Please don't embarrass yourselves any more!

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:33.930
What?

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:35.360
Aiko, why...?

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:41.410
She said that she didn't want to fight jackasses like you guys any more and released me.

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:43.060
Oh.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:45.410
I'm so glad!

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.250
This isn't good!

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:50.450
I've never been this embarrassed before!

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:52.870
We're defenders of justice, you know!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:55.260
Sorry, our bad.

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:56.580
Sorry 'bout that.

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:07.010
To be continued!!

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:05.390
Nothing's really been resolved, though...

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:12.960
Returning to a fuel processing plant in the Nerima subdivision -- the escaping Magical Five.

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:16.760
Like this, we'll be able to fight once again!

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:22.760
Aiko disappears, leaving behind only a piece of paper.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:27.370
The three search through Akihabara to find her.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:29.040
Location: Cafe Meilish

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:35.130
Suddenly, Pachira collapses!

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:37.790
What could be wrong with Pachira?

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.790
Hospital

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:42.600
It's athlete's foot.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:49.020
Hiding the truth from the rest of them, Pachira enters the Magical Five with her fungus-infested body!

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:52.310
I'm going to protect everyone's stars!

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.160
Want to go to the zoo?

00:20:58.160 --> 00:20:59.620
Really?

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:02.790
Uma is tricked into going out with a flasher.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:05.640
I need to find Aiko!

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:08.260
Without her, the Magical Five...

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:09.830
It's this way!

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:13.830
Akihabara Steaks

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:12.970
But, I need to fill up first.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.790
Anime Research Institute

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:17.830
I'm stuffed!

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:19.340
Where's Aiko?

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:23.340
Fake Uma

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:23.340
It's terrible!

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:26.210
Mecha-Hougou is at the fuel processing plant!

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:26.840
What?

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:33.350
If Aiko isn't here at a time like this...!

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:37.350
Sorry for being so late! I must have worried all of you...

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:42.360
With her memory upgraded to four gigabytes, Aiko has returned!

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:43.860
Aiko!

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:50.360
But, Mecha Hongou has destroyed his target.

00:21:50.360 --> 00:21:54.010
What will happen to the Magical Five?

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:57.540
Do they have any initiative left?

00:21:57.810 --> 00:22:00.360
Then suddenly, a mysterious robot appears!

00:22:00.360 --> 00:22:02.160
Is it friend or foe?

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:04.710
And, will it be able to defeat Mecha Hongou?

00:22:05.930 --> 00:22:08.340
Next time, Earth's last day!

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:08.340
Magical 5

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:08.340
The World's Last Day

00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:43.250
Don't you ever wonder about things like, "What if I could use magic?"

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:45.520
I think about it only when I'm in a pinch,

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:49.740
as long as the price I pay isn't my life or my body!
